    "body": "When clicking WCS in the browser tree - it should open a right pane dialog for setting the WCS.. And also name it to G54-59.\nStock as is.\nMachine just opens the machine selector in the right panel for now.\nPost just opens the post selector in the right panel for now.\nFixtures; allows for loading and positioning fixture.\nToollist opens a right dialog for exporting the tool list and a table of list added to the setup.\nOperations is as now it shows a 1+n tree of operations, and clicking that operation will open a dialog to the right_\n\nSelecting which Setup you work on should be  radio button in the browser tree to the left. Click the setup, allows for telling it to use its own stock or inhertied the machine stock from previous in tree operation.  If its the first setup this option does not exist.",
